{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["未来的君王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["但那些受过痛苦的人必不再遇见黑暗。从前，耶和华使西布伦人和拿弗他利人住的地方受人藐视，日后必使这些地方，即约旦河东、沿海一带、外族人居住的加利利得到荣耀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"走在黑暗中的人必看见大光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"活在死荫之地的人必被光照亮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你必使以色列成为大国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们喜气洋洋。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必在你面前欢喜快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像丰收时那样欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同瓜分战利品时那样快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你必折断他们负的重轭和欺压者的棍棒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像昔日你毁灭米甸人一样；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士争战穿的靴子和染血的战袍都要被扔进火里烧掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为必有一个婴儿为我们诞生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一个儿子要赐给我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂肩头必担负王权。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被称为奇妙的策士、大能的上帝、永存的父、和平的君。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的国必长治久安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必坐在大卫的宝座上以公平和公义治国兴邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使国家永固。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华必热切地成就此事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华要审判以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"主已出言审判雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的审判必临到以色列，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲和撒玛利亚的居民都知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们骄傲自大地说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“砖墙倒塌了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们凿石重建；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桑树砍倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们换种香柏树。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此耶和华必兴起利汛的仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驱使敌人来攻击他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"东有亚兰人，西有非利士人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必吞噬以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还没有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罚的手仍没有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"但百姓没有归向击打他们的主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不寻求万军之耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华要在一日之间铲除以色列的头和尾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"棕树枝和芦苇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"头是指他们的长老和首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尾是指教人虚谎之事的假先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些带领者使百姓步入歧途、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"走向灭亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都目无上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行事邪恶，口出妄语。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主不喜欢他们的青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不怜悯他们的孤儿寡妇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还没有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罚的手仍没有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邪恶像燃烧的火焰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"焚毁荆棘和蒺藜，点燃密林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烟柱旋转上腾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华的烈怒必如火烧焦大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓成为烧火的柴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弟兄彼此相煎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们左抢右夺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仍食不果腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"纷纷吃自己的骨肉","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲和玛拿西自相残杀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又联合起来攻打犹大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还没有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罚的手仍没有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"“骨肉”或译“臂膀的肉”。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}